{"run_id":"arm2b-rag-translate-base-q8","qa_id":"hw-pmkmy-06-en","output":{"answer":{"text":"Yes, a farmer who paid income tax last year can join PM-KMY. The scheme excludes persons who paid income tax in the last assessment year, so this farmer is eligible.","citations":["pm-kmy:d0-page-1:0"],"refused":false},"retrieved":["pm-kmy:d1-page-1:0","pm-kmy:d0-page-4:1","pm-kisan:d0-page-3:0","pm-kmy:d0-page-1:0","pm-kmy:d1-page-2:1"],"usage":[{"requested_model":"qwen3-1.7b-base:q8_0","served_model":"qwen3-1.7b-base:q8_0","input_tokens":1179,"output_tokens":63,"latency_s":62.74971849999565,"cost_usd":0.0}],"latency_s":63.954247199995734,"parse_error":null,"search_query":null}}
{"run_id":"arm2b-rag-translate-base-q8","qa_id":"hw-pmkmy-06-hi","output":{"answer":{"text":"The Pradhan Mantri Kisan Maan-Dhan Yojana (PM-KMY) is a voluntary and contributory pension scheme for farmers aged 18 to 40 years, providing a monthly pension of Rs. 3000 upon reaching 60 years of age. The scheme is not limited to Small and Marginal Farmers (SMFs) only.","citations":["pm-kmy:d1-page-1:0"],"refused":false},"retrieved":["pm-kmy:d1-page-1:0","pmmvy:d0-page-2:0","pm-kisan:d1-page-1:0","pm-kmy:d0-page-1:0","pmay-g:d1-page-1:0"],"usage":[{"requested_model":"qwen3-1.7b-base:q8_0","served_model":"qwen3-1.7b-base:q8_0","input_tokens":185,"output_tokens":22,"latency_s":10.729497499996796,"cost_usd":0.0},{"requested_model":"qwen3-1.7b-base:q8_0","served_model":"qwen3-1.7b-base:q8_0","input_tokens":1068,"output_tokens":105,"latency_s":99.0042917000028,"cost_usd":0.0}],"latency_s":112.53683730000193,"parse_error":null,"search_query":"Pradhan Mantri Kisan Vikram Yojana PMKVI"}}
{"run_id":"arm2b-rag-translate-base-q8","qa_id":"hw-pmkmy-07-en","output":{"answer":{"text":"The Pradhan Mantri Kisan Maan Dhan Yojana (PM-KMY) is effective from the 9th August, 2019.","citations":["pm-kmy:d0-page-1:0"],"refused":false},"retrieved":["pm-kmy:d0-page-1:0","pm-kmy:d1-page-1:0","pm-kmy:d0-page-10:0","pm-kmy:d0-page-4:0","pm-kmy:d1-page-8:1"],"usage":[{"requested_model":"qwen3-1.7b-base:q8_0","served_model":"qwen3-1.7b-base:q8_0","input_tokens":1132,"output_tokens":62,"latency_s":137.53861219999817,"cost_usd":0.0}],"latency_s":139.37168320000637,"parse_error":null,"search_query":null}}
{"run_id":"arm2b-rag-translate-base-q8","qa_id":"hw-pmkmy-02-en","output":{"answer":{"text":"The PM-KMY scheme requires subscribers to contribute Rs. 3000 per month. This contribution is voluntary and is part of the scheme's structure.","citations":["pm-kmy:d1-page-1:0"],"refused":false},"retrieved":["pm-kmy:d0-page-10:0","pm-kmy:d0-page-9:1","pm-kmy:d1-page-7:0","pm-kmy:d1-page-8:1","pm-kmy:d1-page-1:0"],"usage":[{"requested_model":"qwen3-1.7b-base:q8_0","served_model":"qwen3-1.7b-base:q8_0","input_tokens":1114,"output_tokens":59,"latency_s":77.53310909999709,"cost_usd":0.0}],"latency_s":79.18741099999897,"parse_error":null,"search_query":null}}
